      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-326097",
      ":question/problem": "A furniture outlet has a dining chair with a set regular price. First, the chair is sold at a discounted price that is $80%$ of the regular price. The outlet then applies a markdown equal to $25%$ of the discounted price. If the final selling price of the chair is $$108.00$, what is the regular price?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
